## Quick start

```bash
uv sync                          # install dependencies
uv run uvicorn src.main:app --reload
# docs at http://localhost:8000/docs
```

## Tests

```bash
uv run pytest
```

## Project structure

```
src/
├── main.py                  # FastAPI app; routers auto-load from the registry
├── core/                    # shared infra (never overwritten by fastgen)
│   ├── config.py            # pydantic-settings, reads .env
│   └── database.py          # async SQLAlchemy Base / engine / get_session
└── modules/
    └── __init__.py          # 📇 module registry (auto-maintained by fastgen)
tests/                       # pytest suite
```

Add a feature module with:

```bash
uv run fastgen make module <feature>
```
